00:24:22.280 --> 00:24:26.440
your own recovery. And this is how you

00:24:24.640 --> 00:24:28.360
actually build capacity to show up

00:24:26.440 --> 00:24:30.520
better in your life, for yourself, and

00:24:28.360 --> 00:24:33.000
for people around you, instead of giving

00:24:30.520 --> 00:24:35.120
everyone this diluted and depleted

00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:37.160
version of you. So, whatever habits or

00:24:35.120 --> 00:24:39.280
obligations that you feel like you don't

00:24:37.160 --> 00:24:41.240
really like, and it's low-key draining

00:24:39.280 --> 00:24:43.440
you, and you're putting it off, give

00:24:41.240 --> 00:24:45.680
yourself the permission to reduce it,

00:24:43.440 --> 00:24:47.480
even just for now, and see where that

00:24:45.680 --> 00:24:49.400
takes you. Habit number eight, and this

00:24:47.480 --> 00:24:50.520
is one of my favorite concepts, and I

00:24:49.400 --> 00:24:52.200
don't think it gets enough attention,

00:24:50.520 --> 00:24:54.000
especially in self-improvement space, is

00:24:52.200 --> 00:24:56.360
that your endorphins, which are your

00:24:54.000 --> 00:24:58.160
brain's natural feel-good chemicals,

00:24:56.360 --> 00:25:00.640
they don't just happen to you randomly.

00:24:58.160 --> 00:25:03.160
You have to kind of deliberately

00:25:00.640 --> 00:25:04.880
