00:25:17.800 --> 00:25:22.200
for our mental health. It also boxes

00:25:20.480 --> 00:25:24.400
down a lot, it makes us more serious

00:25:22.200 --> 00:25:26.600
people, and [music] overall, we have to

00:25:24.400 --> 00:25:28.840
