00:34:16.639 --> 00:34:20.159
you're consciously ending your day

00:34:18.200 --> 00:34:22.520
knowing that you made a few good moves

00:34:20.159 --> 00:34:24.360
today. Even moves that weren't perfect,

00:34:22.520 --> 00:34:26.320
it's okay. You tried it. You're giving

00:34:24.360 --> 00:34:28.200
